{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》即將重磅登場，視后楊茜堯為查清影后閨蜜陳自瑤7年前的「自殺」真相，精心佈局復仇！劇集雲集三大視帝、兩大視后，更促成楊茜堯與陳自瑤繼《宮心計》後相隔17年再合作，昔日宿敵變閨蜜，背後究竟隱藏甚麼驚天秘密？\n</p>\n<h2>楊茜堯復仇佈局 揭娛樂圈最黑暗內幕</h2>\n<p>《玫瑰戰爭》劇情圍繞一場精心籌謀的重逢，揭開遲來七年的續章。故事由陳自瑤飾演的影后關子盈「自殺」身亡展開，相隔7年後，由楊茜堯飾演的摯友夏無雙發現事件另有內情，懷疑昔日在「天誠娛樂」共事的好姊妹們均有份施加傷害。為此，夏無雙以法國片廠代表身份，與陳豪飾演的「天誠娛樂」老闆陳雲生商討開拍電影《玫瑰》，實則暗中盤算復仇大計。劇集以五光十色的娛樂圈為背景，打造「最黑暗職場」，正如宣傳語句所言：「人心難測，繁花之下暗藏殺機，誰能在這場風暴中殺出重圍？」</p>\n<h2>《宮心計》宿敵17年後再合體 楊茜堯陳自瑤變金蘭姊妹</h2>\n<p>除了鑽石級的演員陣容，劇集最大的亮點之一，莫過於楊茜堯及陳自瑤繼經典劇集《宮心計》後，相隔長達17年再度合體。當年二人在劇中分別飾演姚金鈴及錢飛燕，是經典的「利害敵對關係」，鬥得你死我活的場面令觀眾印象深刻。沒想到事隔多年，她們在《玫瑰戰爭》中的關係竟180度大逆轉，由昔日宿敵演變成「情比金堅的閨蜜」，如此巨大的轉變，令不少觀眾大感好奇，究竟二人會擦出怎樣的新火花。</p>\n<h2>老公羅子溢都忍唔住 楊茜堯新劇造型曝光即獲公開示愛</h2>\n<p>視后楊茜堯演技精湛，每次推出新劇都備受關注，這次在《玫瑰戰爭》擔綱復仇大女主，自然引爆全城期待。劇組近日在社交平台發布宣傳物料後，除了粉絲反應熱烈，就連楊茜堯的老公羅子溢也悄悄現身留言區，對著老婆的靚相大方示愛，簡單寫下：「老婆，靚靚」，甜蜜互動閃瞎一眾網民，也足見他對太太新劇的支持。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版勁期待：「姚金鈴錢飛燕合體！」</h2>\n<p>楊茜堯與陳自瑤再度合作的消息一出，立即在網上引發熱烈討論，網民紛紛表示期待值爆燈。不少人直言是衝著二人合體而來：「姚金鈴同錢飛燕竟然變咗好姊妹？呢個組合太癲！」、「等咗17年！為咗楊茜堯同陳自瑤，呢套必追！」、「《宮心計》嘅回憶返晒嚟，但今次唔係鬥，係聯手？好想睇！」、「陣容勁到咁，TVB今年台慶劇真係落重本！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_19580551276aeabf4521573.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_19580551276aeabf4521573.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_786700386aeabf65390b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1350\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_786700386aeabf65390b3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_21129898546aeabf6256eb6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_21129898546aeabf6256eb6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_13303062016aeabf483a981.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_13303062016aeabf483a981.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_930771356aeabf4aabc0a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_930771356aeabf4aabc0a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_13212294116aeabf4d66873.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_13212294116aeabf4d66873.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_9630756136aeabf500d6c3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_9630756136aeabf500d6c3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_14167446386aeabf5261206.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_14167446386aeabf5261206.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1047258286aeabf5495dad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1047258286aeabf5495dad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_20920216856aeabf57d08d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_20920216856aeabf57d08d3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_19264690336aeabf5a990e6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_19264690336aeabf5a990e6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_9313512496aeabf5cc990e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_9313512496aeabf5cc990e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_13422544146aeabf5f024c5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_13422544146aeabf5f024c5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_4029039626aeabf68035bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_4029039626aeabf68035bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_15005104306aeabf6a771cd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_15005104306aeabf6a771cd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:25:52.528296+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1292,"images":15,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:00:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:44.970594+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:39.787514+00:00","content_hash":"65c1ae119336db676e3d00901e03b9c027ddfb68cd389814bb37307a0d453fca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}